{"ticker":"QCOM","updated":"2026-11-07T01:49:58Z","profile":{"longName":"QUALCOMM Incorporated","shortName":"QUALCOMM Incorporated","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.qualcomm.com","fullTimeEmployees":57000,"marketCap":176988700672,"trailingPE":13.02441,"forwardPE":13.23729,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.104562,"pegRatio":0.71,"targetMeanPrice":197.03448,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":100.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.084,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.53103,"operatingMargins":0.15414,"profitMargins":0.31605,"totalRevenue":43120001024,"beta":1.762,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":259.92,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":121.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.35},"summary":"QUALCOMM Incorporated engages in the development and commercialization of foundational technologies for the wireless industry in China, the United States, South Korea, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Qualcomm CDMA Technologies (QCT); Qualcomm Technology Licensing (QTL); and Qualcomm Strategic Initiatives (QSI). The QCT segment develops and supplies integrated circuits and system software with connectivity and computing technologies for use in mobile devices; automotive systems for connectivity, digital cockpit, and ADAS/AD; and IoT, including personal AI and compute devices and industrial, networking, and robotics products. The QTL segment grants licenses or provides rights to use portions of its intellectual property portfolio, which include various patent rights useful in the manufacture and sale of wireless products comprising products implementing LTE, and/or OFDMA-based 5G products and derivatives; and grants licenses to use cellular standard-essential patents, including 3G, 4G and 5G for cellular devices. The QSI segment invests in early-stage companies in various industries, including AI, automotive, consumer, enterprise, IoT, and data center, as well as non-marketable and marketable equity securities, and convertible debt instruments. It is also involved in Qualcomm government technologies and data center businesses; and modular businesses that ","summary_zh":"高通公司在中國、美國、韓國和國際上從事無線產業基礎技術的開發和商業化。該公司透過三個部門營運：Qualcomm CDMA Technologies (QCT)；高通技術授權（QTL）；和高通策略計畫（QSI）。 QCT部門開發並提供積體電路和系統軟體，以及用於行動裝置的連接和運算技術；用於連接、數位駕駛艙和 ADAS/AD 的汽車系統；和物聯網，包括個人人工智慧和運算設備以及工業、網路和機器人產品。 QTL部門授予許可或提供使用其部分智慧財產權組合的權利，其中包括用於製造和銷售無線產品（包括實施LTE的產品和/或基於OFDMA的5G產品和衍生物）的各種專利權；並授予使用蜂窩標準必要專利的許可，包括蜂窩設備的 3G、4G 和 5G。 QSI部門投資於各行業的早期公司，包括人工智慧、汽車、消費者、企業、物聯網和資料中心，以及非流通和流通股本證券以及可轉換債務工具。它還涉足高通政府技術和資料中心業務；和模組化業務","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":160.29,"h":160.29,"l":158.01,"c":160.24,"v":7019700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":160.37,"h":161.6,"l":157.57,"c":158.66,"v":6126000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":158.62,"h":159.21,"l":156.61,"c":158.95,"v":8256900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":159.19,"h":162.07,"l":157.96,"c":161.51,"v":8360200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":161.33,"h":162.33,"l":159.58,"c":161.83,"v":5430600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":161.4,"h":162.68,"l":160.21,"c":161.22,"v":5604800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":161.82,"h":165.0,"l":161.5,"c":164.14,"v":7997500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":164.68,"h":166.37,"l":163.23,"c":165.26,"v":6057800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":166.88,"h":168.86,"l":166.23,"c":168.13,"v":10421200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":169.17,"h":169.58,"l":166.29,"c":166.85,"v":19444400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":166.85,"h":170.22,"l":165.92,"c":169.72,"v":6196600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":169.82,"h":170.85,"l":168.3,"c":169.53,"v":5468400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":169.05,"h":174.44,"l":168.67,"c":173.55,"v":9213700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":171.21,"h":171.97,"l":167.94,"c":169.68,"v":8093700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":169.68,"h":170.93,"l":168.13,"c":169.2,"v":4846000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":169.2,"h":169.84,"l":164.76,"c":165.3,"v":7523100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":165.64,"h":166.84,"l":164.88,"c":166.36,"v":5593300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":165.8,"h":